) found the modulation of the local Simon effect by target presentation mode only when two small boxes served as precues. In addition, our study revealed generally larger local Simon effects for two small boxes as precue than for one large box, a pattern that was not reported by Weeks et al. (
1996
), but mirrored Stoffer’s findings (Stoffer,
